CONTINUOUS (the maximal ideal is open in the `𝔪`-adic topology and is
`ker πuniv`), which is what lets `ρuniv` be base-changed along `πuniv` at all.
`hirr` is what the Chebotarev–Brauer–Nesbitt step consumes.

