The gap is quantitative, not a technicality.  Take `p = 5`, `k = 𝔽₅`, `α = 1`,
`β = 2`, and `q ≡ 1 [MOD 5]` as `IsTaylorWilesPrimeSet` requires.  Then
`ρbar.charFrob q = (X - C 1) * (X - C 2) = X² - 3X + 2` has DISTINCT roots, while
